# KaTeX's font parameters

TeX's font parameters σ and ξ (the `fontdimen`s of `cmsy` and `cmex`) and KaTeX's own additions,
for text, script and scriptscript size, from `sigmasAndXis` in KaTeX's `fontMetrics.ts`; and the
characters KaTeX measures with the metrics of a look-alike (`extraCharacterMap`).

Generated by `tools/gen-layout-tables.mjs` from KaTeX 0.19.1; do not edit by hand.

## References

* KaTeX (MIT licence, see `LICENSE-KaTeX`): <https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX>.
